{"t": 1794110624.2792614, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix.\n\n- Production error: Sentry `CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q` \u2014 `PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist` (Android 15, app 8.2, ~2.9k events). Cause: Android keyboard adds surrounding/inner spaces and lower-cases input, and codes were looked up verbatim.\n- Change: `checkout/promo.py` \u2014 `normalize_code()` now strips surrounding whitespace, removes all inner whitespace, and upper-cases the code, so `' autumn24 '`, `'autumn 24'` and `'autumn24'` all normalise to `AUTUMN24`.\n- Verified locally: normalisation is idempotent for `' autumn24 '`, `'autumn24'`, `'AUTUMN24'`, `' Autumn 24 '`, `'autumn 24'`, and tab/newline-wrapped input.\n\nNote: the ticket only asked for the helper in `checkout.promo.normalize_code`; no lookup call site exists in this checkout tree, so wiring it into the apply path still needs to happen wherever the code lookup lives. Leaving PAY-618 open for review/verification.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
